  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Mephodio/EmiEnchants/raw/master/media/demo.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femienchants\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/11hKNQb2?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2SpfwvM7dm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/bb2913a71d7513370db93a85a313af402b1a41e3ceccb2a87f46847601c05cda/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f446973636f72642d2532333538363546322e7376673f7374796c653d666f722d7468652d6261646765266c6f676f3d646973636f7264266c6f676f436f6c6f723d7768697465\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a> 附加模組，用於查看附魔資訊。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>顯示內容：\n<ul>\n<li>附魔名稱、所屬模組、最高等級</li>\n<li>類別與可套用該附魔的物品清單</li>\n<li>稀有度、權重、每級消耗（詳見 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fEnchantment_weight\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>）</li>\n<li>衝突附魔清單</li>\n<li>是否可透過附魔台獲得</li>\n<li>是否可從村民處購買</li>\n<li>是否可從各種戰利品來源獲得（箱子、釣魚、生物裝備掉落）</li>\n<li>是否被視為珍貴附魔（村民以兩倍價格出售）</li>\n<li>是否為詛咒附魔</li>\n<li>說明文字（若模組或資源包提供）。可前往 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Descriptions</a> 查看。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>檢查物品用途以查看適用的附魔</li>\n<li>檢查附魔書的合成配方或用途以查看其附魔屬性。目前僅支援單一附魔的書，此為 EMI 的限制所致。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Forge 版本適用於 NeoForge 1.20.1。其他版本的支援將稍後推出。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
